prise value, earnings, free cash flow, growth, capital intensity, and a sector-appropriate unit metric using current filings.","financialStatus":"Use the latest AEP filing to compare profitability, liquidity, leverage, dilution, and cash conversion with AES.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000004904&owner=exclude"},{"name":"DOMINION ENERGY, INC","ticker":"D","ownership":"Public","relationship":"Utilities operating and valuation reference for AES.","valuation":"Compare enterprise value, earnings, free cash flow, growth, capital intensity, and a sector-appropriate unit metric using current filings.","financialStatus":"Use the latest D filing to compare profitability, liquidity, leverage, dilution, and cash conversion with AES.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000715957&owner=exclude"},{"name":"Constellation Energy Corp","ticker":"CEG","ownership":"Public","relationship":"Utilities operating and valuation reference for AES.","valuation":"Compare enterprise value, earnings, free cash flow, growth, capital intensity, and a sector-appropriate unit metric using current filings.","financialStatus":"Use the latest CEG filing to compare profitability, liquidity, leverage, dilution, and cash conversion with AES.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001868275&owner=exclude"}],"evidenceReview":{"reviewedAt":"August 2, 2026","annualFilingsUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0000874761&type=10-K&owner=exclude&count=40","quarterlyFilingsUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0000874761&type=10-Q&owner=exclude&count=40","earningsUpdatesUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0000874761&type=8-K&owner=exclude&count=40","proxyFilingsUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0000874761&type=DEF%2014A&owner=exclude&count=40","officialMaterialsUrl":"https://www.aes.com/investors","transcriptPolicy":"Use an issuer-published transcript when available. Otherwise use the official webcast, prepared remarks, earnings release, and 8-K exhibits; third-party transcripts are secondary and may contain errors."},"sources":[{"title":"AES SEC filing library","meta":"SEC EDGAR · Issuer record","href":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000874761&owner=exclude","excerpt":"The issuer record provides AES CORP''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures."},{"title":"AES annual reports","meta":"SEC Forms 10-K · Primary filings","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0000874761&type=10-K&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Annual reports provide the audited financial statements, business and segment description, competition, commitments, controls, and principal risk disclosures."},{"title":"AES quarterly reports","meta":"SEC Forms 10-Q · Primary filings","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0000874761&type=10-Q&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Quarterly reports update financial results, liquidity, cash flow, contingencies, and management discussion between annual reports."},{"title":"AES earnings and current reports","meta":"SEC Forms 8-K · Primary earnings record","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0000874761&type=8-K&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Current reports frequently include earnings releases, presentations, material agreements, leadership changes, and other time-sensitive issuer disclosures."},{"title":"AES proxy statements","meta":"SEC DEF 14A · Governance source","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0000874761&type=DEF%2014A&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Proxy statements disclose executive incentives, board oversight, beneficial ownership, related matters, and shareholder proposals."},{"title":"AES official investor materials","meta":"Company IR · Management commentary","href":"