lude&count=40","excerpt":"Current reports frequently include earnings releases, presentations, material agreements, leadership changes, and other time-sensitive issuer disclosures."},{"title":"CDNS proxy statements","meta":"SEC DEF 14A · Governance source","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0000813672&type=DEF%2014A&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Proxy statements disclose executive incentives, board oversight, beneficial ownership, related matters, and shareholder proposals."},{"title":"CDNS official investor materials","meta":"Company IR · Management commentary","href":"https://www.cadence.com/en_US/home/company/investors.html","excerpt":"Use the company''s official results, presentations, webcast replays, prepared remarks, and transcripts when the issuer makes them publicly available."}]}','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP) ON CONFLICT(ticker) DO UPDATE SET status='published',content_json=excluded.content_json,verified_by=excluded.verified_by,verified_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,published_at=COALESCE(company_dossiers.published_at,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
