VALUES ('A','opportunity','editorial_analysis','Aging populations, unmet medical need, clinical innovation, procedure growth, and health-system productivity can support durable demand. For Agilent Technologies, the owner must test whether analytical instruments, laboratory software, consumables, services, and diagnostics used in life-science, pharmaceutical, chemical, and clinical workflows can gain profitable share rather than treating addressable-market growth as company value by itself.','States the evidence-led path by which the business could expand value.','A official investor materials','https://www.investor.agilent.com/','Use the company''s official results, presentations, webcast replays, prepared remarks, and transcripts when the issuer makes them publicly available.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
