VALUES ('A','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if Agilent Technologies cannot defend its position in analytical instruments, laboratory software, consumables, services, and diagnostics used in life-science, pharmaceutical, chemical, and clinical workflows and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','A SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001090872&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides Agilent Technologies''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
