VALUES ('ACGL','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for specialty insurance, reinsurance, mortgage insurance, underwriting, risk selection, and global capital deployment can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Losses, volatility, collateral changes, or funding stress can impair capital. Capital rules, fiduciary duties, market structure, or misconduct can change economics. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','ACGL SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000947484&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
