VALUES ('ADI','bull_case','editorial_analysis','High-performance analog expertise, broad catalogs, customer design-in, and long product lives can support durable margin and cash flow. Industrial automation, electrification, automotive content, connectivity, and inventory normalization can restore growth. Visible progress in industrial demand and automotive content can improve the durability and quality of earnings. Disciplined reinvestment and capital allocation can convert operating progress into per-share value.','Preserves the constructive interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','ADI investor relations','https://investor.analog.com/','Official earnings releases, presentations, events, governance materials, and shareholder information published by the company.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
