VALUES ('ADI','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Inventory and cycle can weaken the owner outcome; monitor customer and distributor days, cancellations, lead times, utilization, and pricing. Competition and pricing can weaken the owner outcome; monitor txn, nxpi, mchp, local suppliers, design wins, and share. Manufacturing and supply can weaken the owner outcome; monitor internal fabs, foundries, capacity, yields, and geopolitical exposure. A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','ADI SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000006281&owner=exclude','ANALOG DEVICES INC filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
