VALUES ('ADSK','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for design, engineering, construction, manufacturing, media software, cloud collaboration, and subscription workflows can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Products can lose relevance as architectures, standards, or customer preferences change. Large customers, distributors, foundries, or partners can alter demand and bargaining power. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','ADSK SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000769397&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides AUTODESK INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
