VALUES ('ALB','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for lithium production, conversion, specialty chemicals, energy-storage materials, resource development, and long-term supply contracts can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Prices and volumes can move faster than the cost base adjusts. Mines, plants, logistics, safety, or remediation can interrupt output and require cash. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','ALB SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000915913&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides ALBEMARLE CORP''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
