VALUES ('AMCR','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if AMCOR PLC cannot defend its position in flexible and rigid packaging, specialty cartons, closures, healthcare packaging, recycled materials, and global manufacturing and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','AMCR SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001748790&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides AMCOR PLC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
