VALUES ('ANET','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Customer concentration can weaken the owner outcome; monitor top-customer share, capex cycles, insourcing, and pricing. Technology competition can weaken the owner outcome; monitor ethernet versus proprietary fabrics, cisco, white box, and product benchmarks. Supply and components can weaken the owner outcome; monitor lead times, optics, merchant silicon, inventory, and purchase commitments. A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','ANET SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001596532&owner=exclude','Arista Networks, Inc. filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
