VALUES ('BDX','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for medical devices, diagnostics, medication-management systems, laboratory products, and recurring healthcare consumables can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Trials, safety findings, recalls, or weak real-world outcomes can reduce value. Government and private payers can constrain price, access, or utilization. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','BDX SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000010795&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides BECTON DICKINSON''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
