VALUES ('BMY','bull_case','editorial_analysis','Large commercial franchises, oncology expertise, cash flow, and a broad late-stage pipeline can fund portfolio renewal. New products, label expansion, cell therapy, neuroscience, and acquired assets can offset legacy patent losses. Visible progress in growth portfolio and loss of exclusivity can improve the durability and quality of earnings. Disciplined reinvestment and capital allocation can convert operating progress into per-share value.','Preserves the constructive interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','BMY investor relations','https://www.bms.com/investors.html','Official earnings releases, presentations, events, governance materials, and shareholder information published by the company.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
