VALUES ('BMY','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Patent cliff can weaken the owner outcome; monitor exclusivity dates, settlements, generic entry, erosion curves, and litigation. Clinical and launch execution can weaken the owner outcome; monitor trial endpoints, safety, labels, uptake, and manufacturing. Acquisition and leverage can weaken the owner outcome; monitor synergies, milestones, impairments, debt, and returns. A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','BMY SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000014272&owner=exclude','BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB CO filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
