VALUES ('CB','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Reserve inadequacy can weaken the owner outcome; monitor loss triangles, prior-year development, claim severity, and social inflation. Catastrophe exposure can weaken the owner outcome; monitor modeled loss, aggregates, reinsurance, climate, and event claims. Pricing cycle and competition can weaken the owner outcome; monitor renewals, terms, retention, new business, and broker feedback. A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','CB SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000896159&owner=exclude','Chubb Ltd filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
